{{h1}}Handlebars

Handlebars is Mustache-family syntax with helpers, block helpers, and implementation-specific escaping rules.

{{h2}}Authoring
- Use paths and block helpers consistently with the configured runtime.
- Keep custom helpers small and avoid embedding application policy in templates.
- Treat raw or unescaped output as security-sensitive.
- Preserve partial and layout conventions; validate rendered behaviour.

